            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention has an object of providing a modified lipase having excellent stability and reactivity at a high temperature. Provided is a modified lipase with improved reactivity and/or stability at a high temperature, the modified lipase having an amino acid sequence including one or more amino acid substitutions which are selected from the group consisting of T130C-S153C, A249P, F259Y, S282P, S283Y and S300P in the amino acid sequence represented by SEQ ID NO: 1, or an amino acid sequence having 90% or more sequence identity therewith.</p>
            </abstract>
